    "detailed_description": "Every decision you make will shape the course of your journey and determine your ultimate fate.<br><br>To truly thrive in this challenging planet, it is not enough to simply be a skilled warrior \u2013 you must also harness your strategic abilities to find your way;<br><br>-Manage your resources effectively<br>-Use your robots wisely as you explore this mysterious planet<br>-Solve the mysteries and find the key to get back home<br><br>Explore and scavenge during the day for valuable resources, then defend the dome as if it were your very own home during the perilous nights.<br><br>Enemies don't have any morals, beliefs, families; every living species in this planet wants you TO DIE.<br><br>You are isolated. And death is not an escape.<br><br>EITHER FIGHT &amp; SURVIVE ALONE OR DIE ALONE.<br><br><br><strong>As the darkness closes in, will you live to see the dawn once more, or will this be your final sunset?</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "Every decision you make will shape the course of your journey and determine your ultimate fate.<br><br>To truly thrive in this challenging planet, it is not enough to simply be a skilled warrior \u2013 you must also harness your strategic abilities to find your way;<br><br>-Manage your resources effectively<br>-Use your robots wisely as you explore this mysterious planet<br>-Solve the mysteries and find the key to get back home<br><br>Explore and scavenge during the day for valuable resources, then defend the dome as if it were your very own home during the perilous nights.<br><br>Enemies don't have any morals, beliefs, families; every living species in this planet wants you TO DIE.<br><br>You are isolated. And death is not an escape.<br><br>EITHER FIGHT &amp; SURVIVE ALONE OR DIE ALONE.<br><br><br><strong>As the darkness closes in, will you live to see the dawn once more, or will this be your final sunset?</strong>",
    "short_description": "You have only one mission in the STARDOME: TO GET BACK HOME. As the darkness rises, so too does the threat of danger. Flesh-hungry, nightmarish creatures will come for you. Immerse yourself in a first-person action survival game, where resource management is key to your survival.",
